 {:seon.task/name "a-spawns-start-costs-the-same-on-a-bigger-program"
  :seon.task/plan "Red on main before the 2026-10-28 batch and taken out of seon.agent-test then (the owner's rule: a red of unknown cause the batch did not make leaves its test, named here): an agent spawned after main gained 200 forms has a :state phase of 616,608 bytes against 460,304 before, over the bound 1.1x + 64 KiB. A spawn's own work must not grow with main's program (the owner, 2026-10-25). Find what the :state phase reads or builds per form (seon.agent/spawn-phases; the ctx record's pull, the reach graph or index handed at fork, the branch views), fix it at the cause, and restore the deftest from git (it is a-spawns-start-costs-the-same-on-a-bigger-program in test/seon/agent_test.clj at 139bbb75ff)."
